### Listing expenses — GET /api/v1/expenses
# A page of the signed-in person's expenses and pending proposals, newest first. Needs an open session; no CSRF
# token, since it is a read.

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie a sign-in response sets — see session.http.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here
# Set from the XSRF-TOKEN cookie a "read the session" response returns — see session.http; the acceptance below
# needs it.
@csrfToken = paste-the-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value-here

### Unfiltered — the default page, limit 50, offset 0.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Narrowed by status — PENDING or RECORDED.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?status=PENDING
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Narrowed by category.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?categoryId=1
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Narrowed by a period — both days required, the last day included.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/expenses?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}

### Accepting proposals — POST /api/v1/expenses/acceptances
# Moves pending proposals of the signed-in person's own into recorded expenses, by id. Needs an open session and
# the CSRF header, since it writes.

### Two ids, both the signed-in person's own.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/expenses/acceptances
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{csrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "ids": [1, 2]
}

### Changing an entry's category — PATCH /api/v1/expenses/{status}/{id}
# Refiles one of the signed-in person's entries under a different category. The status says which table the id
# names, the document replaces /categoryId and nothing else, and the answer is the entry as it now stands. Needs
# an open session and the CSRF header, since it writes.

### A recorded expense.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/expenses/RECORDED/12
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{csrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/categoryId",
    "value": 42
  }
]

### A pending proposal — the same document, the other status.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/expenses/PENDING/7
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{csrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/categoryId",
    "value": 42
  }
]
